# Keep the production build context small and reproducible. Anything that is
# environment-specific, generated, or secret must never enter an image layer.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.claude
docs
*.md
!apps/api/README.md
# Secrets never enter the build context (they are runtime env, not build inputs).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
